cement\",\n      \"file\": \"src/main.py\",\n      \"line\": 27,\n      \"description\": \"No HTTPS enforcement or HSTS headers. Traffic could be intercepted.\",\n      \"recommendation\": \"Enable HTTPS in production. Add HSTS and security headers.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"low\",\n      \"category\": \"Missing Security Headers\",\n      \"file\": \"src/main.py\",\n      \"line\": 27,\n      \"description\": \"No X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, CSP, etc.\",\n      \"recommendation\": \"Add TrustedHost middleware, security headers for XSS/clickjacking protection.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"riskScore\": 78,\n  \"riskLevel\": \"CRITICAL\",\n  \"summary\": \"This application has critical vulnerabilities unsuitable for production government use: insecure CORS + no auth allows data theft, prompt injection bypasses LLM safety, unencrypted sensitive data at rest/transit, and no rate limiting enables DoS.\",\n  \"recommendations\": [\n    \"CRITICAL: Implement JWT/OAuth2 authentication on all endpoints\",\n    \"CRITICAL: Fix CORS — remove allow_origins=['*'] and credentials=True together\",\n    \"CRITICAL: Move GEMINI_API_KEY to secure secret manager\",\n    \"CRITICAL: Escape/validate all user input in LLM prompts; use XML delimiters\",\n    \"CRITICAL: Enable HTTPS/TLS encryption\",\n    \"HIGH: Implement rate limiting and query length validation\",\n    \"HIGH: Encrypt SQLite database (or migrate to PostgreSQL)\",\n    \"HIGH: Return generic error messages; log details server-side only\",\n    \"MEDIUM: Add security headers (X-Frame-Options, CSP, HSTS)\",\n    \"MEDIUM: Use Pydantic validation for all inputs\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Key Findings\n\n**🔴 Critical Issues:**\n1. **CORS vulnerability** (line src/main.py:34) — allows CSRF attacks from any website\n2. **No authentication** — any attacker can read all HR policy queries and feedback\n3. **Prompt injection** (line src/agents/orchestrator.py:170) — user input not escaped in LLM prompts\n4. **Exposed A